message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "UNFORTUNATELY: replies of 4,269 art institutions to one letter of introduction"
authors:
  - family-names: Kulyk
    given-names: Pavlo
version: "2026.11"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24282476"
url: "https://chaotism.art"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pavlo-kulyk/unfortunately"
keywords:
  - art institutions
  - galleries
  - museums
  - rejection letters
  - gatekeeping
  - correspondence audit
abstract: >-
  One letter of introduction was sent individually to 4,269 art institutions in 91 countries
  between 13 January and 2 December 2025. Every reply was coded by hand. The dataset has one row
  per institution and 79 columns (delivery, automatic and human replies, timing, stated refusal
  reasons, structure and vocabulary of each reply, promises made in automatic replies, and
  prominence measures). It contains no letter texts and no email addresses.
